# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.19-standard-identities-and-aitia-review-traceability.org::#revision-disposition-packets
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
classes: {
  owner: {style.fill: "#E6F5F3"; style.stroke: "#19756C"; style.border-radius: 10}
  design: {style.fill: "#EAF2FF"; style.stroke: "#315B8A"; style.border-radius: 10}
  boundary: {style.fill: "#FFF2DD"; style.stroke: "#9B6C25"; style.border-radius: 10}
}
history: "DESIGN history input / existing review artifacts\nImmutable failures + opposing methods + issue inventory\nScenario MUST resolve trusted predecessor and policy\nRequire complete bounded inventory; see 90.71" {class: design}
rebase: "EXISTING nasa-lifecycle-rebase\nSame subject/scope + different revision -> unstarted\nNo native action-resolution or history-completeness proof\nOld failures excluded from current RF are still historical facts" {class: boundary}
a05: "A05-6 / B -> B2\nSame Rust bytes and pure checker result\nReal r2 review + independence and action closure\nNew participant/completion evidence\nTwo displays never substitute for two reviewers" {class: design}
a06: "A06-6 / S1 source retained\nPending branch -> completed review C-ready\nRecorded C fail branch -> review D\nActual S1 result + independent oracle\nS0 receipt never becomes S1 evidence" {class: design}
a08: "A08-8 / B -> C -> conditional C2\nCorrect callback / cost / proof-status prose\nKeep required engineering goals and open work\nC still blocked if required proof is missing\nC2 needs real resolution, not another pass label" {class: design}
bundle: "DESIGN disposition bundle using existing review artifacts\nEvery inherited issue -> action -> actual result -> independent decision\nEight paragraph locators / source and review manifests / reuse map\nStable T/V content reused; new A and exact criterion bindings\nNo new packet runtime, Catalog or framework" {class: design}
verify: "EXISTING verification adapter boundary\nREQUIRED: inspect content and expected policy/history\nExpanded counters reopen affected review; see 90.71\nMissing closure -> no completion receipt\nCurrent registered fail -> requirements-blocked\nNative context snapshot alone does not seal manifest/history/policy" {class: owner}
result: "EXISTING stage gate at explicit now\nFresh context + eight matching current content receipts\nVerified content must cover action closure; no current fail\nOnly then focused stage admission\nRetain old blocked cuts; later arrivals require new intake/use review" {class: owner}
limit: "QUALIFICATION BOUNDARY\nNew trajectories are authored gold only\nHistory lookup, identity uniqueness and live-use invalidation need tests\nNo new implementation, proof or production admission" {class: boundary}
history -> rebase
rebase -> a05
rebase -> a06
rebase -> a08
a05 -> bundle
a06 -> bundle
a08 -> bundle
history -> bundle
bundle -> verify -> result -> limit
